Consider the table PLANT_NURSERY given below:<br>Table: PLANT_NURSERY<table><tr><th>PlantID</th><th>PName</th><th>Type</th><th>Height_cm</th><th>Price</th><th>Stock</th></tr><tr><td>P01</td><td>Tulsi</td><td>Herb</td><td>30</td><td>80</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td>P02</td><td>Areca Palm</td><td>Indoor</td><td>120</td><td>650</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>P03</td><td>Money Plant</td><td>Indoor</td><td>45</td><td>150</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>P04</td><td>Hibiscus</td><td>Flowering</td><td>60</td><td>220</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>P05</td><td>Snake Plant</td><td>Indoor</td><td>50</td><td>300</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>P06</td><td>Marigold</td><td>Flowering</td><td>25</td><td>40</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>P07</td><td>Mint</td><td>Herb</td><td>20</td><td>50</td><td>30</td></tr></table>B. Write the output of the following queries:<pre>I.   SELECT Type, COUNT(*), SUM(Stock)
     FROM PLANT_NURSERY
     GROUP BY Type ORDER BY Type;
II.  SELECT PName, Price FROM PLANT_NURSERY
     WHERE Height_cm BETWEEN 30 AND 60;
III. SELECT MAX(Price) - MIN(Price) AS PriceGap
     FROM PLANT_NURSERY;
IV.  SELECT PlantID FROM PLANT_NURSERY
     WHERE Stock &gt; 20 AND Type &lt;&gt; 'Herb';</pre>
